{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52300","headline":"诗（幷序） 六十一 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 六十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年何必好，老去何须嗔。\n祖公日日故，孙子朝朝新。\n只道人祭鬼，何曾鬼祭人。\n蹔来何（项疑「还」）须去，知我是谁亲？\n（张锡厚录作二首）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}